(7140892, 1093913, 167257, '<td valign="top">I''m embarrassed that mine took 5th and yours took 7th. I gave yours a 10.  I wanted you to know that I''ve actually shed tears over this photo many times.  I love it.  It really tells a story, just wanted to let you know.</td>', 'I''m embarrassed that mine took 5th and yours took 7th. I gave yours a 10.  I wanted you to know that I''ve actually shed tears over this photo many times.  I love it.  It really tells a story, just wanted to let you know.', '2013-12-09 13:02:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7140896, 1093961, 16148, '<td valign="top">It''s the company not the feast.  Nice candid moment.</td>', 'It''s the company not the feast.  Nice candid moment.', '2013-12-09 13:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
