(7140924, 1093913, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LinMalAng:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m embarrassed that mine took 5th and yours took 7th. I gave yours a 10.  I wanted you to know that I''ve actually shed tears over this photo many times.  I love it.  It really tells a story, just wanted to let you know. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Linda, thank you so much for your kind words.  It means more to me than any ribbon or top 5 that my photo touched someone so deeply.  An honor.</td>', 'Originally posted by LinMalAng: I''m embarrassed that mine took 5th and yours took 7th. I gave yours a 10.  I wanted you to know that I''ve actually shed tears over this photo many times.  I love it.  It really tells a story, just wanted to let you know.   Linda, thank you so much for your kind words.  It means more to me than any ribbon or top 5 that my photo touched someone so deeply.  An honor.', '2013-12-09 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 0),
